# Fork-only: spellcheck add-on dictionary (not part of upstream microsoft/edit, nor of SCOWL).
#
# Common words that the bundled en_US dictionary doesn't know, mostly from software work.
# They're added to it when it loads, so they're never underlined and can be suggested.
#
# Format: one word per line, in lowercase unless it's always capitalized. Blank lines and lines
# starting with `#` are ignored. A word can end in `/` plus affix flags from index.aff:
#   S plural (-s, -es, -ies)   M possessive ('s)   D past (-ed)   G -ing
# A word that the bundled dictionary already accepts doesn't belong here (a test checks this).
# Never add a common misspelling: it would hide that typo everywhere.

